##EXITCODE 1
# --solver missingexec (not simplify -- see the matching comment in
# jsmtlib.properties): this must resolve, via the properties .exec entry and no
# --exec CLI override, to an executable that cannot possibly exist, on every
# platform, so this script's result stays deterministic regardless of which real
# solvers happen to be available where it runs.
$SMT_CMD --solver missingexec $SCRIPTS/ok_sat.smt2
